## Affected Mod

**BaboDialogue / Baka-related event**

Exact mod version used by the reporting user is currently unknown.

---

## Event

**New Gnisis Corner Club Event**

Location:

**New Gnisis Cornerclub – Windhelm**

The issue reportedly occurs during the event involving the Argonian characters entering the inn.

---

## Reported Symptoms

According to the community report, the event can begin normally when speaking with the innkeeper.

However, when the Argonian characters enter the scene, the expected dialogue sequence is skipped.

The player therefore misses part or all of the scripted interaction.

The reporting user was unsure whether the event continued correctly afterward.

---

