## Proposed Community Fix

**Discord user:** `Trolls`

The proposed fix consists of replacing the following compiled Papyrus script:

```text
BaboEventNewgnisisMasterScript.pex
```

According to the author of the fix, the original event script contains an incorrectly written section which prevents the scene from running normally.

The revised script reportedly restores normal operation of the New Gnisis Corner Club event.

---

## Community Fix Description

Reported explanation:

> The event he called for was somehow written incorrectly.

A revised version of:

```text
BaboEventNewgnisisMasterScript.pex
```

was provided on the Baka Discord.

After replacing the original script with the revised version, the reporting user states that the New Gnisis event runs normally.

